        'Darken the photo under the text with a **Curves** or **Black and white** adjustment layer clipped to a rectangle, or a **Gradient overlay** on a shape behind the text.',
        'Put the text on a flat band or box. It reads at any size and looks designed rather than defended.',
        'Move the text to the quietest part of the photo. Outlines fix contrast; they do not fix a busy background.',
